hey guys what's going on I've got an  announcement for uh 2023 so I figured  I'd just jump on uh do a quick video I'm  not exactly sure how long these videos  are allowed to be but uh we'll find out  together uh so as many of you know back  in uh 2017 exactly five years ago to the  month I started creating content on the  internet uh the general idea was put  ideas out there get feedback uh learn  meet a bunch of people uh that's exactly  what I've done I started tweeting I  think I had like 2 000 followers uh so  pretty insane to see kind of where where  we've come uh they serve right in the  newsletter doing the podcast uh  eventually on YouTube We Now reach  millions and millions of people around  the world um sure you know myself and  the team worked pretty hard but I think  we're shocked as to how big this all got  and how many people were able to reach  every single month on top of that  there's been an incredible benefit I've  been able to travel around the world  I've met extraordinary people in every  area of the world I've been able to  raise quite a bit of money  for some great causes help thousands of  people get jobs  in the industry and if I'm really honest  with myself I probably learned more in  the last five years than in the first 30  which is is pretty personally rewarding  but all those benefits didn't come  without a cost there's kind of this like  hidden secret cost that I didn't really  realize until recently and so you know  as we were building out more and more  content I wanted to do more I wanted to  do higher quality anything that I do I  try to work hard at and do it's the best  of my ability so I started to hire a  team and in order to be able to build a  team and support that team we pursued  advertising as the monetization model as  many of you know when you listen to a  podcast you watch YouTube videos there's  ads companies pay and the people who are  creating that content tell you about the  companies that are the advertisers and  that was great but this industry is a  little bit different and so one of the  issues is while we worked with some  amazing advertisers  we also worked with some companies who  did some pretty bad things and what I  realized over the last couple of months  is I was essentially renting my name and  reputation out to these businesses these  are businesses that I don't control  their businesses that don't make  decisions for the businesses that I  don't own and so in some weird way my  reputation was being used for them to  profit that's just not something I'm  comfortable with I think I came to the  conclusion that my reputation is not for  sale and so starting out 2023 I'm taking  all advertisers off the audio podcast  and off the YouTube videos so I'm  essentially blowing up the business I'm  completely destroying it taking Revenue  to zero  um every single person I've talked to  said not to do this I talked to a lot of  people who run businesses own businesses  invest in companies people have run  media companies the whole thing they all  think this is insane they tell me it  won't work I am going to be personally  funding the team at a loss for as long  as it takes and so they told me that I  was going to lose too much money they  said that you can't build content  businesses without advertisers the whole  thing I just disagree I think that this  is definitely the harder path to go by  not having advertisers on the podcast or  on YouTube videos but it is the path  that I think is the right path  um and so I'm committed to building back  uh the business in a a bigger and  stronger way without the advertisers But  ultimately I think it's the right path  because I spent a lot of time talking to  people who listen read and watch I met  some of them in person I did Zoom calls  I did phone calls I talked to them over  email in the last couple of months I've  just been trying to understand what do  they find valuable what do they not find  valuable and so you know one thank you  to all those people who who helped me  kind of think through this but two is  I'm excited to get back to why I started  all this right back in 2017 I just  wanted to learn I wanted to put ideas  out there get feedback and just  accelerate my own personal learning and  then share that with others around the  world I've been able to do that at you  know immense scale and so by not having  the advertisers I'll be able to focus  more and more on that higher quality  content it'll allow me to have the  conversations I want to have with who I  want to have when I want to have them  about what I want to have in those  conversations and so now I don't really  answer to anyone it's just you the  audience the people who watch the people  who read the people who listen uh I  think that you know if I continue to  create really high quality content and I  continue to learn I think there will be  plenty of people who will continue to  watch read and listen and so I don't  really have an ask right now  um I think you know just keep watching  keep listening keep reading uh if you  guys are doing that then I'm doing my  job and uh it's a little scary it's a  little nerve-wracking uh because uh you  know blowing up a business that you work  so hard to create but there's one thing  I learned throughout my career is that  when when something feels right you just  make the decision you do it and we'll  figure it out and in some ways  destroying things ends up allowing you  to set the Bedrock for creating  something new so I'm excited for 2023  hope all of you are as well hope you  guys are all getting off to a fast start  to the year uh we'll have plenty more  announcements we've got some things that  we've been uh been working on uh that  I'll start announcing over the next week  or so  um but I hope everyone has a great start  to the year no advertisers on the audio  podcast or on the YouTube videos and uh  let's get after it see you guys on the  internet
 

